# Preferred/primary-claim VIOLATION fixture (#43). A claim that tries to crown a
# single winner via a gmeow:primaryStandpoint selector — exactly the single slot
# the edit war is fought over. gmeow:NoPreferredClaimShape must fire sh:Violation
# (Principle 9: standpoint-indexed claims are co-equal, no single slot to win).

@prefix ex:    <https://example.org/shapes/> .
@prefix gmeow: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/> .

ex:crimea gmeow:containedInPlace ex:russia , ex:ukraine ;
    gmeow:primaryStandpoint ex:standpoint-ru .

ex:standpoint-ru a gmeow:Standpoint .
